node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output. dist is excluded so the image compiles from source rather than
# shipping whatever happened to be on the build machine — which makes the
# tsbuildinfo line below load-bearing, not tidiness: tsc's incremental cache
# claims those stripped outputs are current and then emits only declarations,
# producing a dist with .d.ts files and no .js.
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo
**/.turbo

.git
.gitignore
*.log

.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml

# Nothing below is read by a build. They are excluded so they never enter the
# build context: every byte here is uploaded to the daemon on every build and
# invalidates the COPY layer that carries it, so docs churn would rebuild the
# app. ~8MB and a cache bust each, for files no compiler opens.
docs
reference
.github
.claude
.impeccable
.history
.vscode
.idea
*.md
!apps/*/README.md
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.prettierrc.json
.prettierignore
coverage
**/coverage
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/__tests__
